                "text": "Republicans have NO plan to save affordable health care \u2014 and they still passed a spending bill that allows the health care tax credits to expire. \n\nThis week, @HouseDemocrats testified until late in the night and brought the stories of our constituents to Congress so Republicans can hear how their policies devastate Americans. And we will continue to fight until Americans can afford the care they need.",
