                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "The fight\u2019s not over. I Voted NO earlier this week on a Senate Republican bill that failed to protect affordable health care for tens of millions of Americans. \n\nWorking families need Republicans to come to the table with Democrats to extend the tax credits that help lower the costs for health insurance. @HouseDemocrats won\u2019t rest until this is done.",
