                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Republican corruption \u2014 plain and simple. Public servants should not take millions in taxpayer dollars to line their own pockets. \n\nRepublicans are more focused on paying themselves than paying for health care for the American people. @HouseDemocrats will continue to make the fight to keep health care affordable a priority.",
