                "retweet_count": 3,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "House Republicans all KNEW, when they blindly voted for a bill that failed to protect health care for millions of Americans, that they were also voting to line the pockets of 8 Republican Senators. They could have stripped it out then \u2014 they didn\u2019t. This corrupt money grab happened because House Republicans let it.\n\n@HouseDemocrats called it out then and will vote tonight to reverse this Republican corruption scheme.",
