                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Thank you Donald Trump and Republicans for making life MORE expensive in 2025. \n\nThis Thanksgiving, Americans remembered who was responsible for devastating cuts to health care and skyrocketing costs of living. Americans had to pay 10% more to celebrate Thanksgiving with their families this year.",
