                "retweet_count": 4,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "The cost of living is too damn high. Too many hardworking Americans live paycheck to paycheck, because everything seems more expensive under Trump and House Republicans \u2014 including health care. \n\nWe need just a few Republicans to join @HouseDemocrats and we could extend the health care tax credits \u2014 because Americans deserve better.",
