                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "The health care tax credits help lower health care costs for tens of millions of Americans. \n\nThe Republicans\u2019 plan? No extension of the tax credits included.\n\nWe need to keep costs down, not skyrocket them. Republicans should join @HouseDemocrats\u2019 plan to extend the tax credits, come Thursday.",
