                "text": "Costs are already too high for hardworking Americans \u2014 they should not have to shell out $1000 or $2000 a month MORE for health insurance because of Republicans\u2019 failure to act. \n\n@HouseDemocrats have a simple and direct way to lower costs by extending the health care tax credits. We need only 4 Republicans to do the right thing to keep premiums from skyrocketing.\n\nhttps://t.co/rF1M67qZpY",
