                "text": "House Republicans\u2019 proposed health care plan will take MORE money from Americans. \n\nWhat do they offer in return? LESS. Less benefits. Less consumer protections. Less care. \n\n@HouseDemocrats\u2019 plan will extend the tax credits that actually lower health care costs \u2014 and we only need 4 Republicans to join. Tens of millions of Americans are counting on Republicans to do the right thing and join us.",
