                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Want to know how pathetic House Republicans are? They\u2019re not even willing to hold a vote on an extension of the health care tax credits. They\u2019d rather screw over the health and wellbeing of millions of working Americans. \n\n@HouseDemocrats are ready to extend the tax credits for 3 years and we need just 4 Republicans to get this done. Americans\u2019 lives depend on it.\n\nhttps://t.co/o5E9FV4Nv4",
